# Copy to prisma/.env (gitignored). Prisma CLI only — never imported by app
# code, never bundled into the app. Same Postgres database as
# FittrLanding/waitlist-app; copy DATABASE_URL from that project's
# waitlist-app/.env.local to get the identical value.
#
# DIRECT_URL is required, not optional: DATABASE_URL there is the
# transaction-mode pooler (port 6543), which doesn't reliably support the
# advisory locks / prepared statements `prisma migrate` needs and hangs
# instead of erroring (see the sibling project's own prisma.config.ts,
# which documents the same thing). Get the session-mode pooler or direct
# connection string (port 5432) from Supabase dashboard: Project Settings ->
# Database -> Connection string.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://...:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true"
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://...:5432/postgres"
